# `google-services.json`, `GoogleService-Info.plist` and every service-account key are ignored in
# the ROOT .gitignore instead — deliberately, not by oversight. Prettier honours only the root
# file, so a credential listed only here is one `pnpm gate` trips over. See the note there.

